### 5. Register `DbContext` in `Program.cs` of API

```csharp
builder.Services.AddDbContext<MoneyPilotDbContext>(options =>
    options.UseSqlServer(builder.Configuration.GetConnectionString("DefaultConnection")));
```

### 6. Create initial migration & update DB

```bash
dotnet ef migrations add InitialCreate -p MoneyPilot.Infrastructure -s MoneyPilot.API
dotnet ef database update -p MoneyPilot.Infrastructure -s MoneyPilot.API
```

